   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Sales promotion items",
   "anchor": "prvky-podpory-prodeje"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Promotional and advertising items are placed inside retail spaces. Their job is to catch the customer’s eye and increase their interest in making a purchase. They are known by the abbreviations POP (point of purchase) and POS (point of sale).",
   "anchor": "prvky-podpory-prodeje"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "What we make: Stands, displays, eye-catchers, advertising totems, shelf decorations, leaflet holders, checkout stands, wall frames, shopping trolley decorations, shop window decals, bags and drink holders, stickers and more.",
   "anchor": "prvky-podpory-prodeje"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Finish: There is a vast choice of colour finishes and a wide range of materials to work with. Just tell us what you have in mind and we will make sales promotion items to measure.",
   "anchor": "prvky-podpory-prodeje"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
