  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "LED displays",
   "anchor": "led-displaye"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "LED displays show the time, date, temperature or price (at petrol stations), for example. They are controlled by a remote control, an app or over a data network. They are also built into advertising totems. Choose from a wide range of colours and two types of display:",
   "anchor": "led-displaye"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Segment displays: They show the digits 0 to 9 and text characters. Depending on the number of segments they come in four types: 7- and 9-segment displays show digits and some text characters, 14- and 16-segment displays show digits and the text characters of the Latin alphabet.",
   "anchor": "led-displaye"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Matrix displays: They consist of an array of LEDs, usually grouped into a square matrix. On a square 8 × 8 LED matrix you can show simple graphics as well as numbers and text.",
   "anchor": "led-displaye"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "led-displaye"
  },
